  "programme": "A brick-walled garden entered through a timber rose arbour: a 5 by 17 m reflecting pool with stone coping on the axis, a stone pool terrace, cross and axis paths, a perimeter gravel walk, four hedged beds of perennials and roses, borders of Swedish columnar aspen along the walls, and a back terrace with a bench before a wall of blank plaques; lawn, flower beds along the front wall, and green ash and bur oak outside.",
